   "pair_ref": null
  },
  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "Momcozy® Wearable Pumps | Hands-Free Pumping | Best-Selling Wireless Pumps | Freedom to Pump Anywhere | Efficient Wearable Pumping | Pump Hands-Free & Cord-Free | Hands-Free & Discreet | More Milk, Less Stress | Portable Pumping for Mums | momcozy breast pump | Discreet & Quiet Pumping | Hospital-Grade Wearable Power | Smart App-Controlled Pumps | Comfort Meets Efficiency | Award-Winning Wearable Pumps | Pump anytime, anywhere with Momcozy® wearable pumps. Designed for your busy lifestyle. | Choose a Pump That Lets You Move Freely. Pump in a Comfortable, Familiar Environment | Join over 3 million mums worldwide. Discover the joy of hands-free, cordless pumping. | Experience the freedom of hands-free pumping. Perfect for work, travel, and home life.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObopeN/Primary Text",
   "heading_path": "Primary Text",
   "meta": {
    "kind": "field_value",
    "field_name": "Primary Text"
   },
   "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObopeN",
   "kb_type": "wording",
   "source_sha256": "ab3bf864c80bdd22864d245438e002af532a1baeff2481a8e9f039b0b82ac14d",
   "order_in_parent": 2,
   "parent_unit_id": null,
   "unit_id": "4512aa7df8f78aec0119",
   "char_count": 758,
   "pair_ref": null
  },
  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ hospital/NICU 场景表述需事实依据，否则删除 ▸ hospital/medical grade 需认证依据，否则删除",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObopeN/修改建议",
   "heading_path": "修改建议",
   "meta": {
    "kind": "field_value",
    "field_name": "修改建议"
   },
   "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObopeN",
   "kb_type": "wording",
   "source_sha256": "ab3bf864c80bdd22864d245438e002af532a1baeff2481a8e9f039b0b82ac14d",
   "order_in_parent": 3,
   "parent_unit_id": null,
   "unit_id": "f24f764c3f95361fceb7",
   "char_count": 299,
   "pair_ref": null
  },
  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；M03 未标注来源的效果数据声明；U03 涉及医院/NICU 场景，需核实临床适用性声明；M05 等级背书用语（需核实是否有对应认证）",
